{{Quote|Miss Theelin Live; A purple people party production; Coming to a galaxy near you this winter|A poster for the "Miss Theelin" beauty pageant|<ref name="Deception">{{TCW|Deception}}</ref>}}
The '''Theelin''' were a rare [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] recognizable by their brightly [[color]]ed [[hair]] and spotted skin.

==Biology and appearance==
[[File:DLT-20ATrooper-SWL.png|thumb|left|250px|A female Theelin rebel trooper]]
A rare [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]], Theelin had three horns on either side of their face,<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> hooved [[Limb|feet]],<ref name="Rystâll Sant" /> brightly [[color]]ed [[hair]],<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> and spotted,<ref name="Theelin" /> mottled skin. They were able to interbreed with [[human]]s to create a [[Theelin-human hybrid|hybrid]].<ref name="Updated and Expanded" />

==Society and culture==
Theelin often had artistic personalities, and many chose to become [[artist]]s or performers,<ref name="Updated and Expanded" /> while a "[[Miss Theelin]]" beauty pageant<ref name="Trivia Gallery">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/deception-trivia-gallery|text="Deception" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 4}}</ref> was available for entry by [[Gender|female]] members of the species.<ref name="Deception">{{TCW|Deception}}</ref> A colonial species, they had migrated and adapted to dominate many worlds.<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

==Theelin in the galaxy==
[[Amos Tillian]] was a [[communications engineer]] who worked for the Galactic Republic during the High Republic Era as part of [[Republic Communications Team Oh-Arr-Ee-Three-Six-One]]<ref name="QftHC">''[[The High Republic: Quest for the Hidden City]]''</ref>  [[Jecki Lon]] was a human-Theelin hybrid and [[Padawan]] of [[Jedi Master]] [[Sol]] during the High Republic Era.<ref name="Interview">{{SW|url=news/leslye-headland-interview|text="Whatever You Think ''The Acolyte'' Is, It's Not": ''Star Wars'' Series Creator Leslye Headland Revels in the First Teaser Trailer}}</ref> The [[bounty hunter]] [[Latts Razzi]] was a female Theelin,<ref name="Latts Razzi">{{Databank|latts-razzi|Latts Razzi}}</ref> as was [[Iron Squadron]] member [[Gooti Terez]].<ref name="Gooti Terez">{{Databank|gooti-terez|Gooti Terez}}</ref> [[Rystáll Sant]], a veteran [[Musician|singer]] and dancer who performed at numerous venues across [[the galaxy]] and with the [[Max Rebo Band]] in the group's more elaborate gigs, was a human/Theelin [[hybrid]].<ref name="Rystâll Sant" /> [[Chass na Chadic]] was a member of the burgeoning [[New Republic]]'s [[Alphabet Squadron]], which was tasked with hunting down the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[starfighter]] unit known as [[204th Imperial Fighter Wing|Shadow Wing]] shortly after the [[Battle of Endor]].<ref name="Latts Razzi" />

